"You aren't from around here are you? Would you be willing to do a task for me?"
msgstr ""
"Вы ведь не здешние? Не возьметесь ли выполнить для меня одно поручение?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:284
msgid "I was told you would be taking me to my new congregation?"
msgstr "Мне сказали, что вы отведете меня к моей новой пастве?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:285
msgid "Welcome! What can I show you?"
msgstr "Добро пожаловать! Что вам показать?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:286 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:292
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Чем могу служить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:289
msgid "Yes, can I help you my child?"
msgstr "Да, чем могу помочь, дитя мое?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:29
msgid "What do you want?!  Leave me alone!"
msgstr "Чего вам надо?! Оставьте меня в покое!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:290
msgid "What is it?  I'm busy!"
msgstr "Что такое? Я занят!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:291
msgid "Do you know anything about repairing fences?"
msgstr "Вы что-нибудь смыслите в починке заборов?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:293
msgid "Yes my child?"
msgstr "Да, дитя мое?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:294
msgid "How can I help you child?"
msgstr "Чем могу помочь, дитя?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:296 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:297 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:298
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:299 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:300 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:301
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:302 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:303 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:304
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:305 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:306 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:307
msgid "Bless you my child."
msgstr "Благословляю вас, дети мои."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:3
msgid "Well met, friends.  What may I do for you?"
msgstr "Рад встрече, друзья. Чем могу служить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:30
msgid "These people think it's the foreman's fault!"
msgstr "Эти люди думают, что виноват бригадир!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:308
msgid "Do you need healing?"
msgstr "Вам нужно исцеление?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:309
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "Ну что еще?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:31
msgid "Hello!  A pleasant day today, is it not?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте! Приятный сегодня денек, не правда ли?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:312
msgid "I don't know what I'm going to do!"
msgstr "Не знаю, что мне теперь делать!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:313
msgid "I am Forblaith, do you have the gift of magic?"
msgstr "Я Форблайт. Есть ли у вас дар магии?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:314
msgid ""
"I've got all kinds of things to sell! What kind I help you with today?"
msgstr "У меня на продажу всякая всячина! Чем могу помочь вам сегодня?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:32
msgid "What do you want?  Can't you see I'm busy?"
msgstr "Чего вам? Не видите, я занят?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:322
msgid "Hm.  There's trouble in the wind.  I can smell it."
msgstr "Хм. Беда носится в воздухе. Я ее чую."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:323
msgid "Got tend to the plowing, it won't get done by itself!"
msgstr "Надо пахать, само не вспашется!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:324 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:325
msgid "Lovely Day isn't it?"
msgstr "Чудесный денек, не правда ли?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:326
msgid "Maybe I should re-thatch the house today."
msgstr "Может, перекрыть сегодня крышу свежей соломой?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:327
msgid "I've got to fix the chimney or the wife will have my hide!"
msgstr "Надо починить трубу, а то жена с меня шкуру спустит!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:328
msgid "I wonder if I can borrow Broccan's plow…"
msgstr "Может, одолжить плуг у Броккана…"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:329
msgid "This is a day for being outside."
msgstr "В такой день только на воздухе и быть."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:330
msgid "Where's that husband of mine?  He's supposed to fix the chimney!"
msgstr "Где мой муженек? Он же должен трубу чинить!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:331
msgid ""
"Hrumph! My family used to have a farm near here but now those Thronish have it."
msgstr ""
"Хмпф! Раньше у моей семьи была ферма неподалеку, а теперь ею владеют эти тронхеймцы."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:332
msgid "Do you know anyone who could give me work?"
msgstr "Не знаете, кто мог бы дать мне работу?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:333
msgid ""
"This village is crawling with Thronish!  How can a good Framish take this?"
msgstr "Деревня кишит тронхеймцами! Как это стерпеть честному фрамцу?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:335
msgid "Who stands before Krohn?"
msgstr "Кто предстал перед Кроном?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:336
msgid "Greetings, Mortals."
msgstr "Приветствую, смертные."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:337
msgid "Blessings, my children."
msgstr "Благословляю, дети мои."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:338
msgid "Come, sit.  Igrid shall comfort you."
msgstr "Подойдите, присядьте. Игрид вас утешит."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:339
msgid "We make the best drinks in all of Arslegaard!"
msgstr "У нас лучшие напитки во всем Арслегаарде!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:340
msgid "You can not buy better weapons than this!"
msgstr "Лучшего оружия вам не купить!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:341
msgid "You look like you could use a good suit!"
msgstr "Похоже, вам не помешали бы добрые доспехи!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:342
msgid "Come in!  Have a look!"
msgstr "Входите! Взгляните!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:344
msgid "Come."
msgstr "Подойдите."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:346
msgid "There is no safer place for your money!"
msgstr "Для ваших денег нет места надежнее!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:348
msgid "How did you get injured up here?"
msgstr "Как это вас ранило здесь, наверху?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:35
msgid "Hello.  Need some stones washed?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Камни помыть не нужно?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:350
msgid "Come in."
msgstr "Входите."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:353
msgid "Boy!  What a grand death I had!"
msgstr "Ох! Какая славная у меня была смерть!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:354
msgid "It's so dull around here."
msgstr "Тут такая скукота."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:355
msgid "It's wonderful here!"
msgstr "Здесь чудесно!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:356
msgid "The booze here is terrible!"
msgstr "Выпивка здесь ужасная!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:357
msgid "The drinks here are great!"
msgstr "Напитки здесь отличные!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:358
msgid "I'm itching for some action!"
msgstr "Руки так и чешутся подраться!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:359
msgid "I miss the days of drinking and fighting!"
msgstr "Скучаю по дням попоек и драк!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:36
msgid "Lindisfarne is a fine place to go!"
msgstr "Линдисфарн — славное место!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:360
msgid "It's getting boring in here."
msgstr "Здесь становится скучно."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:37
msgid "Stand back!  I've got things to do!"
msgstr "Посторонитесь! У меня дела!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:378
msgid "Pardon me.  I've got an important message for you."
msgstr "Прошу прощения. У меня для вас важное послание."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:379
msgid "Greetings, fellow traveller"
msgstr "Приветствую, собрат-странник"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:38
msgid "May you always find warm flame, friend."
msgstr "Пусть вас всегда согревает пламя, друг."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:387 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:392 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:397
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:402 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:407 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:412
msgid "Good Day."
msgstr "Добрый день."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:39
msgid "May your fire always stay lit, friend."
msgstr "Пусть ваш огонь никогда не гаснет, друг."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:4
msgid "Hello.  What do you want?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Что вам нужно?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:400
msgid "Locks and keys giver!!"
msgstr "Раздаю замки и ключи!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:240 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:41 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:418
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:436 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:61
msgid "Hello.  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Чем могу служить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:414
msgid "Presenting..Nicolai!!"
msgstr "Встречайте... Николай!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:415
msgid "I am A-number one!"
msgstr "Я лучше всех!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:419
msgid "How did you get in here?"
msgstr "Как вы сюда попали?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:42
msgid "May your blade stay sharp, friend."
msgstr "Пусть ваш клинок не тупится, друг."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:423
msgid "Good day, friends."
msgstr "Добрый день, друзья."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:424
msgid "Bless you, my children."
msgstr "Благословляю вас, дети мои."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:429
msgid "Step right up!  Care to play a game?"
msgstr "Подходите, не стесняйтесь! Сыграем?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:430
msgid "Welcome!  Are you here to fight or bet?"
msgstr "Добро пожаловать! Вы здесь драться или делать ставки?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:432
msgid "Whom do you serve?"
msgstr "Кому вы служите?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:434
msgid "Why are you bothering me?"
msgstr "Зачем вы мне докучаете?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:435
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me."
msgstr "Спасибо, что спасли меня."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:437
msgid "Dean is a goober!"
msgstr "Дин — дурачок!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:438
msgid "Dean's feet are green"
msgstr "У Дина зеленые ноги"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:439
msgid "Dean airplanes are rotten!"
msgstr "Самолетики Дина — дрянь!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:44
msgid "Good day.  Were you looking for me?"
msgstr "Добрый день. Вы меня искали?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:45
msgid "Greetings, adventurers.  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Приветствую, искатели приключений. Чем могу служить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:46
msgid "You need something, friend?"
msgstr "Вам что-то нужно, друг?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:47
msgid "Hello?  What's that you said?"
msgstr "А? Что вы сказали?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:48
msgid "Who are you?  How did you find me?"
msgstr "Кто вы? Как вы меня нашли?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:49
msgid "My father is a great man!"
msgstr "Мой отец — великий человек!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:5
msgid "Hi there.  Would you like to buy some armor?"
msgstr "Привет. Не хотите купить доспехи?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:50
msgid "Hello!  Would you like to buy something?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте! Желаете что-нибудь купить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:51
msgid "Hello?  Who are you?  What do you want?"
msgstr "А? Кто вы? Что вам нужно?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:52
msgid "Hmmm?"
msgstr "Гм?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:53
msgid "Hello!  What sort of weapon did you need today?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте! Какое оружие вам сегодня нужно?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:135 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:54
msgid "Have I got some armor for you!"
msgstr "Есть у меня для вас доспехи!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:55
msgid "Who are you?  How did you get in here?"
msgstr "Кто вы? Как вы сюда попали?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:56
msgid "Hello!  Here to do some banking?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте! Пришли по банковским делам?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:57
msgid "Come in!  Drink up!"
msgstr "Входите! Пейте до дна!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:58
msgid "Welcome.  Did you need some healing?"
msgstr "Добро пожаловать. Вам нужно исцеление?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:59
msgid "Hello!  C'min!"
msgstr "Здрасьте! Заходите!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:6
msgid "Greetings, stranger.  Buy an old man a drink?"
msgstr "Приветствую, чужестранец. Не угостите старика выпивкой?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:60
msgid "You looking for a boat?"
msgstr "Ищете корабль?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:63
msgid "Ahh!  Those were the days!"
msgstr "Эх! Вот были времена!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:64
msgid "He really went to Arslegaard, you know!"
msgstr "А ведь он и правда побывал в Арслегаарде!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:65
msgid "Don't tell her, but I think she's fibbing"
msgstr "Только ей не говорите, но, по-моему, она привирает"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:66
msgid "Hello?  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Да? Чем могу служить?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:68
msgid "Hello.  How are you?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Как поживаете?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:7
msgid "Why have you bothered me?"
msgstr "Зачем вы меня побеспокоили?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:70
msgid "I can't talk to strangers."
msgstr "Мне нельзя разговаривать с незнакомцами."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:171 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:195 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:219
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:229 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:236 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:371
